WEBVTT

00:23.840 --> 00:28.839
(Based on Softstar Technology
single-player game "Chinese Paladin 3")

00:28.840 --> 00:35.359
(Copyright Notice)

00:35.360 --> 00:36.879
(Viewers under the age of majority
should watch with guardian permission.)

00:36.880 --> 00:38.689
(The content depicted in this film
is fictional.)

00:38.690 --> 00:40.520
(Do not imitate in real life.)

00:58.820 --> 01:01.789
♪Blades of wind cut through dark clouds,
sunset flares to life♪

01:01.790 --> 01:04.060
♪Staining the vast sky red♪

01:04.550 --> 01:09.720
♪A fierce spirit forges a sacred sword,
unafraid of demons♪

01:10.300 --> 01:13.089
♪Breaking the heavens,
shattering the shrouded dark♪

01:13.090 --> 01:15.959
♪Breaking the dream,
thorns blinding the way♪

01:15.960 --> 01:18.379
♪Breaking love,
trapped in hatred and obsession♪

01:18.380 --> 01:21.129
♪The sword's edge ignites
with burning blood♪

01:21.130 --> 01:24.109
♪Fight to the fullest♪

01:24.110 --> 01:26.899
♪Burn to the fullest♪

01:26.900 --> 01:29.689
♪For the one I love♪

01:29.690 --> 01:32.439
♪No regrets whether laughter or tears♪

01:32.440 --> 01:35.239
♪I never stop searching♪

01:35.240 --> 01:38.460
♪I never stop falling♪

01:41.020 --> 01:44.130
♪A furious roar shakes the earth
and pierces the sky♪

01:53.760 --> 01:56.799
=Sword and Fairy 3=

01:56.800 --> 01:59.400
=Episode 11=
=Battle of Leizhou: Part Two=

02:03.620 --> 02:04.979
Three great heroes of Shu Mountain.

02:04.980 --> 02:07.739
The prefect is awaiting
your arrival at his residence.

02:07.740 --> 02:08.859
Please follow me.

02:08.860 --> 02:10.060
Thank you for leading the way.

02:10.360 --> 02:13.160
(Prefect's Residence)

02:18.180 --> 02:21.420
The houses in this prefect's residence
are quite peculiar.

02:22.220 --> 02:23.939
You heroes may not be aware

02:23.940 --> 02:26.379
that thunder and lightning rage
above Leizhou City year-round.

02:26.380 --> 02:29.079
That is why the prefect
had every household's eaves

02:29.080 --> 02:31.060
fitted with iron beasts
to ward off lightning.

02:31.740 --> 02:35.179
Changqing, even if the Leizhou Prefect
knows where the Thunder Spirit Pearl is,

02:35.180 --> 02:37.220
will he really hand it over to us?

02:37.420 --> 02:38.700
Let's go with the flow.

02:38.900 --> 02:39.899
I heard

02:39.900 --> 02:42.620
that demon disturbances
were once frequent in Leizhou City.

02:43.140 --> 02:45.299
Demons have surrounded
Leizhou City for many years,

02:45.300 --> 02:47.219
but we are protected
by the Thunder Deity.

02:47.220 --> 02:50.099
Never have demons been allowed
into the city to trouble the people.

02:50.100 --> 02:51.660
The Thunder Deity?

02:56.180 --> 02:57.300
Are you all right?

02:57.500 --> 02:58.540
Do not touch me!

03:04.940 --> 03:06.300
You are injured.

03:06.980 --> 03:08.739
You are from Shu Mountain?

03:08.740 --> 03:09.699
Yun Ting,

03:09.700 --> 03:10.859
who allowed you to come out?

03:10.860 --> 03:11.699
Go back at once.

03:11.700 --> 03:12.499
Father,

03:12.500 --> 03:13.140
I...

03:14.140 --> 03:16.619
Young Master Yun Ting,
do not run around anymore.

03:16.620 --> 03:18.620
The master has already grown angry.

03:21.780 --> 03:23.860
Please come inside.

03:24.580 --> 03:26.020
That child...

03:26.180 --> 03:28.060
That is the prefect's only son.

03:28.220 --> 03:29.980
He is an ill-fated child.

03:30.420 --> 03:31.940
Just leave him be.

03:32.140 --> 03:33.860
An ill-fated child?

03:35.220 --> 03:36.940
Young heroes, this way please.

03:41.740 --> 03:44.349
You have come
all the way from Shu Mountain

03:44.350 --> 03:47.019
to help Leizhou resist the demons.

03:47.020 --> 03:48.980
I am deeply grateful.

03:49.020 --> 03:50.620
There is no need for courtesy, Prefect.

03:50.720 --> 03:53.100
Slaying demons and eliminating evil
is the duty of our sect.

03:54.480 --> 03:56.950
To be frank, Prefect, we're here

03:57.020 --> 03:58.389
for another matter too.

03:58.390 --> 04:01.100
Have you ever heard
of the Thunder Spirit Pearl?

04:03.100 --> 04:04.539
I have not.

04:04.540 --> 04:06.089
Prefect, you may not be aware,

04:06.090 --> 04:07.819
the Demon-Sealing Pagoda
of Shu Mountain has been breached.

04:07.820 --> 04:10.059
A great number of demons
have escaped from the tower.

04:10.060 --> 04:12.859
If we don't get the Five Spirit Pearls
to restore the seal,

04:12.860 --> 04:15.219
countless demons within will swarm out.

04:15.220 --> 04:16.380
When that happens,

04:16.860 --> 04:18.620
the mortal realm
will become a living hell.

04:19.980 --> 04:24.540
I see. No wonder these demons
have grown so rampant.

04:25.740 --> 04:26.900
The war drums.

04:27.260 --> 04:28.219
Prefect,

04:28.220 --> 04:29.340
demons!

04:29.380 --> 04:31.219
A large number of demons
have gathered outside the city.

04:31.220 --> 04:32.340
Come with me.

04:51.140 --> 04:52.260
So many of them.

04:52.660 --> 04:53.860
They arrived so quickly.

04:57.150 --> 04:59.910
Soldiers, prepare for battle!

05:04.220 --> 05:08.940
Night is the time that belongs
to the Demon Clan.

05:13.860 --> 05:15.220
Release the arrows!

05:25.620 --> 05:26.820
Hold the line!

06:04.980 --> 06:05.619
Xuejian,

06:05.620 --> 06:07.139
you and Changqing protect the prefect.

06:07.140 --> 06:08.100
All right.

06:59.060 --> 07:00.159
It is the Thunder Deity!

07:00.160 --> 07:01.540
We are saved!

07:04.220 --> 07:05.780
Whoever offends Leizhou

07:06.180 --> 07:07.540
shall be executed.

07:10.420 --> 07:11.540
This is...

07:12.540 --> 07:13.459
General Shi,

07:13.460 --> 07:14.580
seize him!

07:22.060 --> 07:24.900
By divine rite,
I command the thunder spirit,

07:25.070 --> 07:27.900
striking terror
into demons and spirits alike.

07:27.940 --> 07:30.620
Within me roars the thunder,
the Thunder God unnamed.

07:30.700 --> 07:33.540
Across the Three Realms,
I alone stand supreme.

07:49.180 --> 07:50.140
Ting!

07:51.940 --> 07:52.899
Look!

07:52.900 --> 07:54.700
Is that not Young Master Yun Ting?

07:55.860 --> 07:57.259
It really is him.

07:57.260 --> 07:59.700
So Young Master Yun Ting is the one
who has always protected Leizhou City.

08:00.100 --> 08:01.340
We are saved!

08:06.020 --> 08:07.740
So it truly is that child.

08:09.420 --> 08:11.780
So Yun Ting is the Thunder Deity.

08:12.540 --> 08:13.259
Ting,

08:13.260 --> 08:14.380
come back now!

08:14.700 --> 08:17.099
The Thunder Deity, the Thunder...

08:17.100 --> 08:18.860
The Thunder Spirit Pearl is on Yun Ting.

08:19.180 --> 08:20.059
This is bad.

08:20.060 --> 08:21.300
Yun Ting is in danger.

08:28.980 --> 08:29.900
Ting!

08:31.340 --> 08:32.180
I will save him.

08:36.180 --> 08:37.900
I will go with you to save Yun Ting.

08:38.820 --> 08:39.700
All right.

08:41.100 --> 08:41.939
The Thunder Spirit Pearl

08:41.940 --> 08:43.360
is mine now!

08:47.140 --> 08:48.200
Let me go.

08:48.530 --> 08:49.670
Let me go.

08:57.660 --> 09:00.700
So the Thunder Spirit Pearl
is within you.

09:01.060 --> 09:03.659
What a prize delivered without effort.

09:03.660 --> 09:05.140
What Thunder Spirit Pearl?

09:05.220 --> 09:08.379
You truly did not know
the Thunder Spirit Pearl was within you?

09:08.380 --> 09:11.539
It is a treasure that can
greatly amplify one's power.

09:11.540 --> 09:15.980
Otherwise, how could
you possibly wield lightning?

09:17.220 --> 09:18.500
(So that is the truth.)

09:19.380 --> 09:21.420
(What is happening? I have no strength.)

09:23.020 --> 09:24.460
Do not struggle.

09:24.540 --> 09:29.340
Once I extract the Thunder Spirit Pearl,
you will see for yourself.

09:48.140 --> 09:49.660
Let him go.

09:58.020 --> 09:59.970
Yun Ting, are you all right?

10:02.420 --> 10:05.780
I... I cannot muster any strength.

10:05.900 --> 10:07.259
You have been poisoned.

10:07.260 --> 10:08.699
The venom of
this spider demon is potent.

10:08.700 --> 10:11.059
Xuejian, take Yun Ting
back into the city now.

10:11.060 --> 10:12.180
What about you?

10:12.260 --> 10:13.419
Tian and I will hold them off.

10:13.420 --> 10:14.540
Go, now.

10:15.210 --> 10:16.070
Go.

10:17.380 --> 10:19.050
Don't escape.

10:38.140 --> 10:39.420
Seize them!

10:39.460 --> 10:40.980
Do not let them get away!

11:19.940 --> 11:21.220
Let's go.

11:23.340 --> 11:24.299
Leave me.

11:24.300 --> 11:25.860
Go after them!

11:53.420 --> 11:54.460
Changqing,

11:54.820 --> 11:56.460
this cannot continue.

11:57.060 --> 11:58.579
Tian, hold on.

11:58.580 --> 11:59.859
You must not fall.

11:59.860 --> 12:01.339
Bind and subdue the demon fiends.

12:01.340 --> 12:02.980
Behead the six ghost blades.

12:12.540 --> 12:14.850
The Ten Thousand Swords Technique
of Shu Mountain?

12:15.020 --> 12:17.429
Your spiritual power
is nearly exhausted.

12:17.430 --> 12:19.599
Isn't this the same as courting death?

12:19.600 --> 12:21.269
Besides, you are alone.

12:21.270 --> 12:23.660
What difference can you possibly make?

12:30.700 --> 12:34.699
Bind and subdue the demon fiends.
Behead the six ghost blades.

12:34.700 --> 12:38.500
The heavens resound with righteous qi.
My Dao rises in prosperity.

12:49.660 --> 12:52.729
Who said I was alone?

12:52.730 --> 12:55.439
The Ten Thousand Swords Technique
of Shu Mountain!

12:55.440 --> 12:56.640
(Ten Thousand Swords Technique)

13:16.860 --> 13:18.120
Uncle He Yang,

13:18.140 --> 13:19.740
it is fortunate you arrived in time.

13:19.980 --> 13:20.859
Are you all right?

13:20.860 --> 13:21.659
We are fine.

13:21.660 --> 13:22.580
No harm done.

13:32.820 --> 13:34.659
Uncle, please be cautious.

13:34.660 --> 13:36.869
Tian and I will find a way
to capture the Demon Clan Commander.

13:36.870 --> 13:37.950
Very well.

13:46.310 --> 13:47.510
Shou Zhen.

13:47.520 --> 13:50.070
I sense a familiar aura nearby.

13:50.100 --> 13:51.909
The rest of you, engage with caution.

13:51.910 --> 13:53.509
You, come with me to take a look.

13:53.510 --> 13:54.630
Yes.

14:30.460 --> 14:31.660
Yu'er.

14:33.740 --> 14:34.940
Yu'er.

15:08.660 --> 15:11.020
Fight. Kill.

15:11.060 --> 15:14.339
Let your fury and unwilling hearts

15:14.340 --> 15:18.180
become the power that feeds me.

15:29.340 --> 15:30.460
Ting.

15:35.100 --> 15:36.180
Ting.

15:37.540 --> 15:38.660
Father,

15:38.710 --> 15:41.019
so the lightning within me

15:41.020 --> 15:43.160
comes from this Thunder Spirit Pearl.

15:43.580 --> 15:48.100
Those demons came
for the pearl inside me, did they not?

15:48.220 --> 15:53.020
All the misfortune
that struck Leizhou began because of me.

15:55.080 --> 15:56.210
Ting!

15:56.850 --> 15:57.939
Yun Ting.

15:57.940 --> 15:59.249
You have no cultivated power.

15:59.250 --> 16:01.560
Removing the pearl like this
could cost you your life.

16:09.460 --> 16:12.990
They say the pearl
can greatly amplify one's power.

16:13.700 --> 16:15.960
They need it more than I do.

16:18.810 --> 16:19.309
But...

16:19.310 --> 16:21.070
Take it to them, quickly.

16:21.600 --> 16:22.730
Go.

16:23.780 --> 16:24.859
All right.

16:24.860 --> 16:26.230
I will make sure it reaches them.

16:43.020 --> 16:44.100
Jing Tian!

16:55.020 --> 16:56.819
It is dangerous here. Why return?

16:56.820 --> 16:58.659
Yun Ting asked me to give you the pearl.

16:58.660 --> 17:00.180
You must defeat them.

17:00.680 --> 17:02.480
(Flying Rock Technique)

17:31.980 --> 17:34.460
Pay for the innocent lives

17:34.900 --> 17:35.879
lost in Leizhou!

17:35.880 --> 17:37.760
(Storm-Calling Sword)

18:04.060 --> 18:05.529
That brat

18:05.530 --> 18:07.220
is messing up my plans again.

18:25.420 --> 18:27.010
Not long ago,

18:27.460 --> 18:29.620
they were still training
with me on Shu Mountain.

18:30.340 --> 18:34.820
Who could have done this
to Uncle He Yang and Shou Zhen?

18:35.180 --> 18:38.480
Their remains are incomplete.
This is beyond cruel.

18:45.460 --> 18:47.760
These demons harbor deep hatred
toward Shu Mountain.

18:47.940 --> 18:49.179
But

18:49.180 --> 18:52.579
Uncle He Yang was one
of the five Shu Mountain Elders,

18:52.580 --> 18:53.940
his cultivation profound.

18:54.220 --> 18:57.540
Even if maintaining the
Five Elements Array drained him greatly,

18:57.780 --> 18:59.620
it should not have ended like this.

19:01.180 --> 19:02.500
On this battlefield,

19:02.820 --> 19:05.780
could there be
another hidden demon at work?

19:06.580 --> 19:09.539
The spirit is the true self.
The body is but an illusion.

19:09.540 --> 19:11.059
(Thunder)
The phantom form is a disguise.

19:11.060 --> 19:12.779
If this life's just a stopover,

19:12.780 --> 19:14.300
what's there to cling to?

19:14.820 --> 19:18.180
When I ascend, I can split
into hundreds with no limits.

19:18.420 --> 19:20.780
Forms perish within a hundred years,

19:20.980 --> 19:22.820
yet the essence endures.

19:23.300 --> 19:25.979
The mortal path is faint.
The immortal path is vast and distant.

19:25.980 --> 19:28.139
When disciples enter Shu Mountain,

19:28.140 --> 19:30.220
they seek
the fulfillment of the Great Dao.

19:30.420 --> 19:32.860
What they vow to protect
is all living beings under heaven.

19:34.100 --> 19:35.860
May the immortal path be fulfilled

19:36.980 --> 19:38.900
and the mortal path
not fall into despair.

19:49.010 --> 19:50.289
Unite sword and qi,

19:50.290 --> 19:51.770
ride the sword and soar.

19:52.010 --> 19:52.930
Rise!

19:54.450 --> 19:55.690
It worked!

19:56.690 --> 19:57.850
Jingjing.

20:19.050 --> 20:22.329
♪War flames rise,
the mountains and rivers tremble♪

20:22.330 --> 20:25.649
♪Reincarnation begins,
cause and effect fall into chaos♪

20:25.650 --> 20:29.329
♪The night grows thick, dark as ink♪

20:29.330 --> 20:32.529
♪The wheel of fate starts
to turn backward♪

20:32.530 --> 20:35.689
♪Crimson palace walls,
stained with blood and tears♪

20:35.690 --> 20:39.369
♪Vows scatter with the wind,
fading into the clouds♪

20:39.370 --> 20:43.089
♪Moonlight cannot pierce this darkness♪

20:43.090 --> 20:49.569
♪Who cries out in loneliness
from the abyss♪

20:49.570 --> 20:53.049
♪The net of destiny tightens ever more♪

20:53.050 --> 20:56.529
♪The lock of karma
binds a lifetime unbroken♪

20:56.530 --> 20:59.929
♪Love and hate entwined beyond escape♪

20:59.930 --> 21:03.329
♪Not awaken in a world of chaos♪

21:03.330 --> 21:06.689
♪Stars shatter, heaven and earth mourn♪

21:06.690 --> 21:10.209
♪Snow fills Shu Mountain,
only ruins remain♪

21:10.210 --> 21:13.569
♪Five elements in balance,
six realms side by side♪

21:13.570 --> 21:16.889
♪All for the sake of the living♪

21:16.890 --> 21:21.690
♪Stepping onto a path of no return♪

21:37.640 --> 21:39.779
(Next episode preview)

21:39.780 --> 21:42.060
Only upon waking from a great dream

21:42.320 --> 21:44.580
does one see
how much the world has changed.

21:47.140 --> 21:48.580
You have finally come.

21:50.820 --> 21:52.859
You know the person from my dream?

21:52.860 --> 21:53.819
I do.

21:53.820 --> 21:55.099
As for the reason,

21:55.100 --> 21:56.780
you will learn it
in the Celestial Realm.

21:58.340 --> 21:59.580
If you dare, follow me.

22:02.780 --> 22:04.240
If I am only a burden,

22:04.620 --> 22:06.400
then let us go our separate ways!

22:07.020 --> 22:08.070
Xuejian.
